<title>UK: ING Barings leads $50 mln 15-year high yield bond.</title>
<headline>ING Barings leads $50 mln 15-year high yield bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SNAP CAYMAN LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     16.50     MATURITY    25.APR.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPREAD     +940 BP   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  10-100</p>
<p> GOV LAW    WNLISH    FULL FEES  UNDISC    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR U.S.T.  NOTES	REPACKAGE DEAL BASED ON THE UNDERLYING BRAZILIAN DCB</p>
<p>		AVERAGE LIFE 10.76 YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
